3. Validates the pinned field is exactly `"1"`/`"0"`, throwing `malformedFormat` otherwise.
4. Builds `Note` from `[id, title, pinned, body]`, and for `tags` reuses the existing `extractTags(from:)` on the body — no tag logic reimplemented.

